### Windows
# Windows thumbnail cache files
Thumbs.db

# Folder config file
[Dd]esktop.ini

# Recycle Bin used on file shares
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# Windows shortcuts
*.lnk

### Review output
# Reports this plugin writes when reviewing this repository with itself
review-reports/

### Eval output
# Per-run eval results. Only evals/baseline.json is committed — otherwise every
# eval run would need a plugin version bump, churning the cache key for nothing.
evals/results/

### Agent tooling state
# Session, HUD, and notepad state written by the assistant tooling in use.
# Local scratch, not repository content — anything here worth keeping is moved
# into the repository proper (docs/, tests/) rather than committed from these
# directories.
.omc/
.sisyphus/

# opencode 설치본 — scripts/install-opencode-skills.mjs가 생성한다
.opencode/
